FROM:
Eric Hammer, Development Department Planner
DATE:
4/12/2017
SUBJECT:
Revised Map for The Bluffs 11tu1 Filing Preliminary Plat (UDC-17-00138)
Dear City Councilmembers and Madam Mayor,
The City of Cheyenne Development Department has received a revised preliminary plat map for The
Bluffs 11th Filing, which was Item #25(b) on the City Council agenda held on 4/10/2017. The application
will be considered by the Public Services Committee at a regularly scheduled meeting on 4/18/2017.
Previously, Development Department Staff and the Planning Commission recommended the application
be conditionally approved with seven (7) conditions. The revised preliminary plat map adequately
addresses six (6) of these conditions and staff has changed their recommendation to recommend
approval of the application with one (1) condition, listed on the item’s staff report as Condition #3. It
reads as follows:
3. Change the name of Kristina Bluff to a name with less similarity to an existing city street.
The updated preliminary plat map has been provided to Kris Jones, Executive Assistant to the City
Council, for distribution and is also attached to this memorandum. The cover page for the staff report
submitted to the City Council has been revised to include the updated staff recommendation.
If you have any questions regarding this memorandum or The Bluffs 11th Preliminary Plat, please contact
me by either of the methods below.
Regards,
Eric Hammer
Planner
ehammer@cheyennecity.org
(307) 638-4342
End:
Map
